_pdbx_database_remark.text   
;SEQUENCE
A sequence database reference for this protein does
not currently exist.
The SEQRES of chain L includes His tags(AAGHHHHHH)
on the C-terminus. The SEQRES of chain H includes 
His tags(SAGHHHHHH) on the C-terminus.
The residue numbering of chain H corresponds to Kabat 
database in which the residue numbers of antibody 
are defined. The residues in variable region are 
assigned with non-sequencial number. 
;
